cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or data, please cite it as below.  The code in this
  repository is released under the MIT License; the released data files
  (data/TGSD_sample/ and data/series-new_curated.csv) are released under the
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).  See
  LICENSE for both terms.
title: "sro-gascade: code and data for leakage-safe evaluation of enclosed-chamber CO2-CH4 curves"
abstract: >-
  Sliding-window sequence reorganization (SRO), the GASCADE dual-axis gated
  encoder (DSG + BiLSTM + CORAL), and the leakage-safe evaluation protocol for
  termite count estimation and coarse infestation grading from enclosed-chamber
  gas curves, together with a sample of the Termite Gas Sensing Dataset (TGSD)
  and the curated series table.
